---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const updated = "2026-09-02";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer — AAwallet"
  description="AAwallet is educational content by undergraduate students. It is not investment advice."
>
  <div class="container disclaimer measure">
    <p class="kicker">Disclaimer</p>
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated <time datetime={updated}>{updated}</time>.</p>

    <div class="body stack">
      <p>
        <strong
          >AAwallet is educational content produced by undergraduate students.</strong
        > Nothing on this site is investment advice, financial advice, or a
        recommendation to buy, sell, or hold any security or other financial
        instrument.
      </p>

      <h2>No advice, no relationship</h2>
      <p>
        The authors are not registered investment advisers, broker-dealers, or
        financial professionals. Reading this site does not create an advisory,
        fiduciary, or professional relationship of any kind. The content does not
        take into account your objectives, financial situation, or needs. Before
        acting on any information here, do your own research and consult a
        licensed professional.
      </p>

      <h2>Accuracy and completeness</h2>
      <p>
        The analysis is provided "as is," without warranty of any kind, express
        or implied. Figures may contain errors. Data may be out of date. Models
        rest on assumptions that are stated in each post and that may prove
        wrong. The authors make no representation that any analysis is accurate,
        complete, or current, and accept no liability for any loss arising from
        reliance on it.
      </p>

      <h2>Forward-looking statements</h2>
      <p>
        Pitches contain opinions and forward-looking statements about companies
        and markets. These are inherently uncertain. Actual outcomes will differ,
        often materially. A price stated in a pitch is the price at the time of
        publication only; posts are not updated for subsequent price movement.
      </p>

      <h2>Positions and conflicts</h2>
      <p>
        Each pitch carries the author's position in the security as of
        publication. Unless a pitch states otherwise, assume the author may hold,
        acquire, or dispose of a position at any time after publication without
        notice.
      </p>

      <h2>No returns tracking</h2>
      <p>
        Each pitch may carry a status and a dated update log. The
        <a href="/glossary">glossary</a> indexes every post published here. Neither
        contains performance or returns data. Nothing on this site should be read
        as a claim of investment performance.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party content</h2>
      <p>
        Links to third-party sites and references to third-party data are
        provided for convenience. The authors do not endorse and are not
        responsible for third-party content.
      </p>

      <p class="footer-note">
        By using this site you agree that the authors and AAwallet have no
        liability for any decision made or action taken in reliance on its
        content.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .disclaimer {
      padding-block: 1.75rem 2rem;
    }
    .kicker {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--ink-3);
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 1.3rem + 2.4vw, 2.6rem);
      margin-block: 0.35rem 0.35rem;
    }
    .updated {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--ink-3);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }
    p {
      color: var(--ink-2);
    }
    .footer-note {
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
      color: var(--ink-3);
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
